    th\xF4ng s\u1ED1 ch\u1EA5t l\u1ECFng. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P13 + P06 \u2014 m\u1ED9t
    cung v\xF2ng r\u1ED9ng, \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ng\u1EAFn v\xE0 l\u1ED7 th\u1EA5y
    r\xF5.\nRecovery: C\xF3 kho\u1EA3ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\xEDch \u0111\u1EC3
    quay l\u1EA1i; kh\xF4ng c\xF3 nh\xE1nh k\xEDn ho\u1EB7c h\xE0nh lang d\xE0i"
